				2.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				399b22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγνωστος καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>in Prm.</u>
